  "goodToKnow": "Die Weisung is an instruction or directive from a superior: auf Weisung von, Weisungen erteilen, weisungsgebunden (bound by instructions). In Germany, public prosecutors are weisungsgebunden to the justice minister, which the EU Court criticised in 2019 when it ruled they couldn't issue European arrest warrants. The everyday word is die Anweisung. Plural: die Weisungen."
